{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>到快時尚服飾店挑選衣物時，許多民眾都會先至試衣間試穿以確認版型與尺寸。日前有網友分享，自己在UNIQLO等門市試穿後，如果他沒有打算購買，為了體貼店員，往往會主動將衣物一件件掛回原架上。然而，這項看似善意的舉動曝光後，卻引來不少UNIQLO前店員與服飾業同行現身急勸「千萬別這麼做」，直言這反而是替工作人員增加負擔。</p><p>一名網友在社群平台Threads發文表示，每次到服飾店試穿結束後，雖然店員總會親切提醒「不需要的衣服給我就好」，但他即使不買也會默默將衣服拿回賣場掛好。看似貼心的行為，卻立刻引發同行熱烈討論。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339064933978112431267.jpeg/shjUL-lEcGihrsajn-Us11rvx8dk7RYGdLv0K3S79Cs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339067924647936074192.jpeg/YTPMAS4qtzTSxqx7_LTBejbdcrb5ChQM1M7_odTO_6E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339070483304448721895.jpeg/mZnl5vblVoa8NnO8xMKQ-O46qLDKAtJcLLB9qiywfao\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339073134235648561378.jpeg/UWiRSvapbntgfxPVjXwA4H_SIVSwgiCoyto1ZcraNWU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339075386707968740961.jpeg/mcinH5AWvZ7BkJYqx_vJl9GdwyAfClhxU9ynm1Pcp5s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339078746476544270653.jpeg/kHJbIBFWq3kBnJR6V1PfDFUNHMZ8rexJDjmb9g45m_Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339081321910272752890.jpeg/x2xlQlfX-DC8BN6CAIdev44pUie5VQ3BuiG7V7ohu1c\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339083784097792706185.jpeg/ODskVwq7RLG8jQzng0HP5aAoJqnbqxB-To26YU6NumE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339086552469504512836.jpeg/V1DLQWpmHHwK_RBT59cQUbTGaI1A4Tt0RmXah0Zl2oc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339088985296896132756.jpeg/q7d_d_Ck_aFxebb6NYxu7WgPDvzZhKTuX4If3l-CH94\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339060567707648405138.jpeg/ucxuXTRaOZ6m-zV3qkdFUWfeWZtHF_PtKd_yUCnf8lA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339063415771136693584.jpeg/MLdIjNQcnD78t5l5YX-icnmvM3muUG_XqVwtNKlcLTQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341319498207232961302.jpeg/oJl30NNiq6zHPAHkI3Z83-B0C207xd9kMw-NcDMPjXA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341322413379584128365.jpeg/O2mOiOoboA0VrmZcZP5XSoOmIOHzKcryhVz3i4Vc94s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341325844451328492605.jpeg/eZlMTSjrCnbcZn8cC8KagoWUlk_SyAoQ9F7le_Re5Xs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341328428273664634508.jpeg/y0cWF-pk-dP3KSmrMOJFMRkYyx1r3sk7Hzn1qx859as\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341332274581504275863.jpeg/lUsaOg1izAdNOnnZcT9wUVpbQXSYrBw-S9bmT0vW5k8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341335273639936403925.jpeg/QIHd5C304LVOReN4WE3YDk3puulqb_361C-oLdQvqC0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341338977341440678491.jpeg/hVU8d5g62tS2ZoOgfggUsQusSLD5uxivvLSFq7y0has\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341341812822016314072.jpeg/RH18Zo1kTvz5EqGEngqeSoReBicOZQ3GEhvsaBIb7Gg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341344673468416695148.jpeg/h71Q4aPDtFcCLOasrzT2b3cWgw1GGy5PHbsbVh27G1Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341347731247104619473.jpeg/MHIDcOtKzEdRf45Cb_X5ikhamWIbar02vDHAfbwxwH0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341315400372224107853.jpeg/rm0KRbyQ8728qFO7Fmunh-wz4-z0HmQLb63xI2-t8SM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341318336516096274869.jpeg/6Ho1qH0VvBriFQFMtMtTdKq_cljJKeOEo8nx8qPJ8fI\"/><p>不少曾任職於UNIQLO及服飾業的網友紛紛留言苦勸：</p><p>「如果你不是百分之百正確的能整理還原成原本的樣子，那你還是不用客氣直接還給店員整理就好」</p><p>「你這樣掛回去，結果被主管發現衣服凌亂他們會被罵，即使你掛得很整齊，但是他們有一定規定的掛法」</p><p>「我以前也會掛回去或著折回去，後來知道他們有規定的折法跟掛法之後，我都直接拿給店員處理了」</p><p>有服飾業者在留言區進一步解釋，顧客想幫忙的初衷固然值得肯定，但服飾店對衣物的陳列標準、尺碼順序與吊掛方式都有嚴格規範。更關鍵的是，顧客試穿後的衣物，店員都必須先仔細檢查領口等處是否不慎沾染粉底、唇膏等彩妝污漬，確認無損並重新撫平整理後，才會依照規定歸位上架。因此，業者一致建議，試穿後若無購買意願，「直接整把交還給店員」才是最專業、也最能幫到工作人員的正確做法。</p><p>我們除了在服飾店常常聽到「不需要的給我就好了」以外，還常在試穿衣服結束後，聽到「試穿辛苦了」，先前曾有網友尷尬表示，他不覺得自己只是換衣服，有什麼辛苦之處，反而是要整理衣服、接待顧客的店員更忙碌，因此他都會有點彆扭，不過有網友指出，UNIQLO是日本企業，當地服務業經常使用「辛苦了」等禮貌用語，店員可能只是藉此感謝顧客試穿，並非真的認為換衣服是一件費力的事。</p><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173531614187520142598.png/Pny_7nFy1KGyCXhUc37asnBONWvo4nqGNaD3RjWg90Y\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173533937963008731254.png/HpWSqG4Dk-jWUkG7KBihG5XHQZV6oaZm0P-CidD_gok\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173536005885952098231.png/vT4ImV0WkJNw5fRkCv8W4uXFnxjnTqAERuK3NUbitzU\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173538203832320247890.png/IfewsxnC_0J7ES5YcL2Nsb8tY3Tyd2VFrI82gqyPNoI\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173540439527424790356.png/TJ7scbxcBuecFAbhmDrxYtaTXPUVkRbv8nZKz_J2Ss8\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173531618381824725963.png/z8ApDopXD9AA0JpOU6pbM8O9DicgOEgnc1vTenNb03o\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173534390947840678324.png/9iKUpy0uyn77PntMu6njEqu38KgU0gOfS6kx3kupMd4\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173536702140416531298.png/zEJD2TMSETcH6HV0xBxqRAhDfo7GAcRnKbqoiSm6qIk\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcapt