_7oms___3_Fc2kBLac2kbpArAoYlTg9GYo3vRmKN4\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173536635031552368409.png/vLVwPm__DnStE1Q72U9mci8kcy86uuVhtM9EELTPRBA\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173538992361472179083.png/fL2-8IFitahdCnRpRntDGvbBFpCxQX7HgHLrS4By60s\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173541232250880508742.png/OS3Uq0Pjot983CUy3dorXhMKXTsGQz_I9JrcXfSa3F0\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035173529269571584258310.png/C-CjXwW1A-AG1Xi8UuDzBweFng3-C_NAuXH7Zrlx-2Y\"/><figcaption>盤點日本五大逐漸消失的職場潛規則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>赴日購物結帳注意！他曝「1動作」恐讓店員愣住 正確做法曝光</p><p>38歲台女遊日遭割喉亡…河口湖飯店登日本凶宅網 網直呼：衰到不行</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:21:26.989529+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1348,"images":45,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T04:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:05.768012+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:05.768012+00:00","content_hash":"2bd43b5eca561f47594ae363b41fd6139cf7049805070063919aa5c2948428f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}